pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# NP-1 gate: open and close SETTINGS (F6) 100 times, navigate it with only
# the keyboard, only the pad and only the mouse, then resume free roam and
# drive, so the guest is shown to get its input back. Check the run with
# tools/check-fh1-settings-gate.py.
